## AI Agent Reasoning

### Context

In Light and High Contrast Light, the bottom of the terminal displayed a
black strip before any text selection occurred.

### Decision

xterm's bundled stylesheet assigns a black background to `.xterm-viewport`.
When the canvas does not consume the full viewport height, that default is
visible. The app now overrides it with a theme-specific terminal-background
token, preserving the terminal's actual canvas background rather than using
the adjacent panel color.

